after Nikki Haley.

00:33:04.615 --> 00:33:06.484
She's a member of the club.

00:33:06.484 --> 00:33:07.418
She's paid her dues.

00:33:07.418 --> 00:33:08.987
They're not worried about her.

00:33:08.987 --> 00:33:12.056
But they are going after
President Trump still.

00:33:12.056 --> 00:33:15.660
They have not left this man
or his family alone at all.

00:33:15.660 --> 00:33:20.665 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I think Governor
DeSantis has great potential

00:33:21.866 --> 00:33:23.101
