the United States.

00:33:23.101 --> 00:33:24.802 align:start size:81% position:19%
I just want him
to wait till 2028.

00:33:26.104 --> 00:33:28.406
- Any final thoughts or
should we end on that?

00:33:29.574 --> 00:33:31.042 align:start size:81% position:19%
That seemed pretty
clear. (laughs)

00:33:31.042 --> 00:33:33.111
- I love President Trump,
and Governor DeSantis,

00:33:33.111 --> 00:33:35.413
