I'll be freaking thrilled.

00:33:41.252 --> 00:33:43.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll be thrilled if
DeSantis is the president.

00:33:43.221 --> 00:33:44.422 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's like, that's
why I just don't want

00:33:44.422 --> 00:33:46.824
the mutually assured destruction

00:33:46.824 --> 00:33:48.226
that seems like it's on the way.

00:33:48.226 --> 00:33:49.727 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Yes.
- So we shall see.

00:33:49.727 --> 00:33:50.928
- We shall see.

00:33:50.928 --> 00:33:52.196
